  vcxproj condition). THE one real ABI item: Win32 `__fastcall(pThis, dummy-EDX, â€¦)` __thiscall
  emulation must carry NO dummy on x64 (single convention, this in RCX) â€” **`ENGINE_THIS` macro
  seam** (engine_advertise.cpp + engine_groundScene_forward.h + mirrored block in
  GroundScene.cpp); GroundScene.h/Os.h **guarded friend decls were the first-build breaker** â€”
