One important finding: `Audio::getSamplePlayBackStatus()` polls `AIL_stream_status`, but `rg` shows 
no engine-side caller in `clientAudio/src`; the per-frame `Sound2d::alter` path does not use stream 
status. It treats the sound as started once it has been queued, then relies on callbacks or ordinary 
deletion rules.
